1
00:00:01,112 --> 00:00:02,276
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:02,277 --> 00:00:03,686
step in deeply behind

3
00:00:03,687 --> 00:00:05,775
controlling the arm and the back of the neck

4
00:00:06,176 --> 00:00:07,618
cut down into the mat,

5
00:00:08,619 --> 00:00:10,356
as Uke raises back up

